WARNING:DEVICE_ATTR_FUNCTIONS: Consider renaming function(s) 'show_ideapad_fan' to 'fan_mode_show' 'store_ideapad_fan' to 'fan_mode_store'
#119: FILE: drivers/platform/x86/ideapad-laptop.c:396:
